<title>USA: Dow drops more than 50 points.</title>
<headline>Dow drops more than 50 points.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average lost more than 50 points Wednesday as the market extended Tuesday's correction, led by further selling in technology shares.</p>
<p>At 11:47 a.m. EDT, the Dow was off 50.31 points at 6,011.49, which activated the New York Stock Exchange's limits on program trading.</p>
